  "new_original_pdf_pages": 191,
  "scope": "The raw q7 endpoint has proved oscillatory strong asymptotics and positive limsup; adjacent two-term blocks contain an exponentially large nonzero term. Prime-filter arguments give eventual nonzero on specified infinite subsequences for fixed zeta weights and Catalan without assuming irrationality. Actual target height, local Lucas factors and full gcd formulas are proved. The bound on weighted exceptional primes needed for the primitive no-go criterion is unproved. Raw growth and safe-LCM failure are not unconditional primitive failure. Finite certificates, hashes and visual checks do not replace the all-scale written analytic and arithmetic proofs.",
